data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":", \"content\": \"# d002 — Colour Greeting implemented\\n\\n## Branch\\n\\nCommitted to `cs-sandbox/<DEVELOPER:1>.<GROUP:1>` as `871270f`\\n(\\\"Implement Colour Greeting page per DESIGN.md\\\"), on top of the merged\\norchestrator design (`3cd2423`, brought in via `git merge\\nrefs/campaign/orchestrator` — fast-forward).\\n\\n## Documented commands (README.md)\\n\\n- Build: `npm run build`\\n- Serve: `npm run serve`\\n\\n## What was built (per DESIGN.md)\\n\\n- React 19 + Vite single page, state held with `useState`.\\n- `@codesweep-ai/ui` installed with `npm install @codesweep-ai/ui`; npm wrote\\n  `^0.3.0` into `package.json` (no `latest`). Optional peers (`mermaid`,\\n  `puppeteer`, `pixelmatch`, `pngjs`) left out.\\n- Page wrapped in `AppShell`; its `Header` (`title=\\\"Colour Greeting\\\"`, no\\n  navItems, no actions) at the top and its `Footer` (\\\"Built with the\\n  codesweep design system\\\") at the bottom.\\n- `h1` greeting with exact text `Hello, world!`; three `Button`s\\n  (`variant=\\\"secondary\\\"`, `size=\\\"md\\\"`) labelled Blue / Orange / Violet in a\\n  centred row beneath it; the greeting-plus-buttons group is vertically\\n  centred in the content area.\\n- Colours are tokens only — `--color-cat-1` (Blue, default on load),\\n  `--color-cat-6` (Orange), `--color-cat-5` (Violet) — applied via\\n  `style={{ color: \\\"var(\u003ctoken\u003e)\\\" }}`. Verified: no hex values anywhere in\\n  the application source.\\n- Styles imported once at the entry point (`src/main.jsx`):\\n  `styles/core.css`, `styles/components/app-shell.css`,\\n  `styles/components/button.css`.\\n- Dev server bound to `0.0.0.0` port 5173 via `vite.config.js`; confirmed\\n  reachable on the network interface.\\n- `.gitignore` (holding `node_modules/` and `dist/`) written before the\\n  first commit; neither was committed.\\n\\n## Verification\\n\\n- `npm run build` — passes (vite v8.3.5, 1746 modules, no errors).\\n- `npm run dev` — server comes up on 0.0.0.0:5173; served page and\\n  transformed modules confirmed to contain the greeting, all three tokens,\\n  Header/Footer/Button.\\n- `grep` over `src/`, `index.html`, `vite.config.js`, `package.json`,\\n  `README.md` — no hex colour values.\\n\\nNothing held back; no known gaps.\\n"},"index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793343222,"id":"chatcmpl-f5875d03","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

